OL,3,GNEWSADanny Dyer among celebrities at
OL,4,Awater industry protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Danny Dyer, his daughter Dani
OL,7,FDyer and singer Becky Hill have
OL,8,Fattended a protest in Kent demanding
OL,9,Fpublic ownership of the water industry.
OL,11,FActivists from Surfers Against Sewage
OL,12,Fdescended on Leysdown on Sunday after
OL,13,F315,000 signed a petition calling for
OL,14,Fthe water industry to be returned to
OL,15,Fpublic ownership.
OL,17,FRivals and EastEnders star Dyer, who
OL,18,Fhas been running a caravan park on Isle
OL,19,Fof Sheppey as part of a new TV series,
OL,20,Ftold the BBC: "Sometimes when you look
OL,21,Fout to the sea, you can smell the twang
OL,22,Fin the air."
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
