OL,3,GNEWSADanny Dyer among celebrities at
OL,4,Awater industry protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FWater UK said that "no sewage spill is
OL,7,Fever acceptable", while Southern Water
OL,8,Fsaid it was committed to reducing storm
OL,9,Foverflows.
